OL,3,AITV investigating soap actor after bar
OL,4,Aincident
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV is investigating a Coronation
OL,7,FStreet actor following an alleged bar
OL,8,Faltercation.
OL,10,FJacob Roberts is known for playing Det
OL,11,FCon Kit Green on the ITV soap since
OL,12,F2024. According to reports by the Sun
OL,13,Fnewspaper, video footage appears to
OL,14,Fshow him shouting outside Kiely's Irish
OL,15,FBar in Manchester on 8 November.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said officers
OL,18,Fhad attended a bar in Watson Street at
OL,19,Fabout 02:30 GMT following reports of a
OL,20,Fdisturbance. No arrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
